WEBVTT

00:02.070 --> 00:03.480
Darling...

00:03.880 --> 00:05.860
Do you love me?

00:06.120 --> 00:10.820
Huh? Y-Yeah, of course I do.

00:12.980 --> 00:14.110
I see.

00:17.340 --> 00:19.370
So that's what happened.

00:19.800 --> 00:23.640
Do you think I've done something
 to make her doubt my love?

00:23.640 --> 00:27.560
I see. This is quite a fascinating 
case study, I think.

00:27.560 --> 00:28.880
Huh? What do you mean?

00:29.400 --> 00:30.630
Here's an example...

00:31.180 --> 00:32.870
Say you're looking at a work of cubism.

00:32.870 --> 00:37.640
Whether or not you see it as a work of art 
or just doodles depends on the person.

00:38.080 --> 00:39.570
In the same way,

00:39.570 --> 00:43.640
even individual words can be interpreted 
differently between men and women!

00:43.950 --> 00:46.430
Huh? I-Interpreted differently?

00:46.430 --> 00:47.150
Yep.

00:47.580 --> 00:50.320
You have a cat, don't you, Senpai?

00:50.320 --> 00:51.640
Y-Yeah...

00:51.950 --> 00:58.030
To put it in those terms, 
what Tsukassan said amounts to purring.

00:58.030 --> 00:58.550
What?

00:58.810 --> 01:01.580
She already knows that you love her.

01:01.580 --> 01:03.840
She got closer to you and 
started purring like that

01:03.840 --> 01:06.040
because she wanted you 
to show some affection.

01:06.040 --> 01:09.920
What would you do if a cat did 
something like that, Senpai?

01:10.310 --> 01:13.280
You'd probably want to 
pet them for a while, right?

01:13.280 --> 01:14.420
Y-Yeah...

01:14.420 --> 01:16.930
And yet what was your response?!

01:17.580 --> 01:19.800
Do you love me?

01:20.100 --> 01:23.310
Huh? Oh, yeah, of course I do.

01:25.310 --> 01:29.200
How could you be so cold to a purring kitty?!

01:29.190 --> 01:33.820
<b>Ack</b>

01:29.200 --> 01:33.820
And you're wondering if she's questioning
 your love?! Well, I sure as hell am!

01:33.820 --> 01:35.620
I-Is that what it was?!

01:35.620 --> 01:36.930
That's right!

01:36.930 --> 01:39.700
And there's only one appropriate 
response for that situation:

01:40.130 --> 01:44.200
You've gotta show your affection to her 
until she's satisfied! It's the only way!

01:46.100 --> 01:49.460
<i>Well, I don't think he was annoyed, but...</i>

01:52.270 --> 01:54.650
<i>It probably was annoying.</i>

01:54.650 --> 01:56.220
<i>It has to be, right?</i>

01:56.220 --> 01:58.970
<b>How He Truly Feels
Does he get annoyed when you ask,
"Do you love me?"</b>

01:56.570 --> 01:58.970
<i>That's why I don't ask too often.</i>

01:59.850 --> 02:04.330
<i>You're the only one allowed to whisper 
sweet nothings to me, you know.</i>

02:46.520 --> 02:55.270
TONIKAWA

02:46.520 --> 02:55.270
TONIKAWA

03:36.520 --> 03:41.110
<b>Episode 8      When You Actually Like It</b>

03:36.920 --> 03:42.030
<i>If there's one thing I've learned in the 
relatively short time I've been married,</i>

03:42.450 --> 03:46.740
<i>it's the importance of expressing 
things verbally with women.</i>

03:46.740 --> 03:50.000
Consider the words, "I love you."

03:50.480 --> 03:56.050
A cutie pie like me is probably going to hear
 that from no shortage of guys in the future,

03:56.050 --> 03:59.510
in no less than five different 
languages, I'd wager.

03:59.510 --> 04:04.640
But Tsukassan is married, and you're the 
only one allowed to say that to her!

04:05.200 --> 04:07.550
So if you stop saying it to her?

04:07.550 --> 04:12.640
It means she'll never hear 
those words ever again!

04:12.640 --> 04:14.650
The same applies to other stuff, too!

04:14.650 --> 04:20.400
Telling a girl she's cute or 
pretty is like watering a flower!

04:20.400 --> 04:23.760
You must never forget your responsibility!

04:24.660 --> 04:27.130
<i>I don't think I've been forgetting,</i>

04:27.130 --> 04:30.160
<i>but I'll admit I haven't been 
too aggressive about saying it.</i>

04:30.760 --> 04:34.580
<i>What's considered the right timing to 
tell someone you love them, though?</i>

04:34.580 --> 04:36.970
<i>Isn't it a little weird to tell someone,</i>

04:36.970 --> 04:40.310
<i>"You're pretty," or "You're so cute," 
during daily life, with no real lead-in?</i>

04:40.310 --> 04:44.740
<i>And when you consider I lived 18 years 
never needing to say those kinds of things,</i>

04:44.740 --> 04:48.010
<i>I don't know how I'm suddenly 
supposed to adapt.</i>

04:48.910 --> 04:52.430
<i>But if I don't figure something out, 
I'll be letting Tsukasa-chan down!</i>

04:52.430 --> 04:55.940
<i>And it is true that I think about 
how cute she is every day!</i>

04:56.560 --> 04:59.690
<i>That's right! This is totally doable!</i>

04:59.710 --> 05:02.690
<b>TV</b>

04:59.710 --> 05:02.690
<b>Sunday Music
Party</b>

04:59.710 --> 05:02.690
<b>The Hot New Idol Group!!</b>

05:00.470 --> 05:02.690
<i>What did you think of that song?</i>

05:02.690 --> 05:05.010
<i>I was really anxious about 
singing it for the first time!</i>

05:03.380 --> 05:07.200
You're way prettier than 
those idols, Tsukasa-chan.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.830
<i>Yeah, I get the feeling 
that's a terrible idea!</i>

05:13.150 --> 05:15.430
<i>First there's the "Where'd that 
comparison come from?" factor,</i>

05:15.430 --> 05:19.080
<i>and what if Tsukasa-chan 
likes that idol group?!</i>

05:19.400 --> 05:22.880
<i>And more than that, it sounds 
like either flattery or sarcasm!</i>

05:22.880 --> 05:26.590
<i>Which means the best timing is probably...</i>

05:32.980 --> 05:35.600
Good morning, Tsukasa-chan.

05:35.970 --> 05:38.300
You're as incredibly cute as ever today.

05:39.130 --> 05:42.420
Uh... okay. Thank you.

05:43.310 --> 05:46.240
I'm going to get changed and 
help out at the bathhouse.

05:49.580 --> 05:51.330
<i>Well, that didn't work!</i>

05:51.330 --> 05:52.430
<i>What did I do wrong?</i>

05:52.430 --> 05:55.250
<i>I know there's more to it 
than just saying the words.</i>

05:55.250 --> 05:57.750
<i>And I really did put a lot 
of thought into that one!</i>

05:58.450 --> 06:01.090
<i>But this confirms a theory of mine.</i>

06:01.090 --> 06:03.750
<i>To be honest, I was pretty sure 
beforehand, but this settles it!</i>

06:03.750 --> 06:06.720
<i>I need to practice before 
this will turn out right!</i>

06:07.430 --> 06:11.510
<i>These words that I never had any use 
for in the 18 years I've been alive...</i>

06:11.510 --> 06:15.480
<i>Of course I won't be able to use them 
right in my daily life all of a sudden!</i>

06:15.480 --> 06:17.140
<i>That much should've been obvious!</i>

06:17.560 --> 06:21.400
<i>But just because I'm not good at it now 
doesn't mean it should stay that way!</i>

06:22.120 --> 06:24.600
<i>Loving words are like English!</i>

06:24.600 --> 06:27.170
<i>You gotta keep learning and practicing, 
or you'll never be any good!</i>

06:27.170 --> 06:29.910
<i>I'm gonna start by studying with shojo manga!</i>

06:33.610 --> 06:38.430
<i>My husband has started reading shojo manga 
whenever he takes a break from work.</i>

06:39.390 --> 06:40.420
Tsukasa-chan...

06:42.220 --> 06:44.800
Shojo manga is pretty interesting!

06:45.270 --> 06:49.550
<i>My husband, as a rule, 
has no sense of proportion.</i>

06:49.800 --> 06:50.300
<b>Read</b>

06:49.830 --> 06:55.060
<i>When he gets into something, he absorbs
 huge amounts of it as quickly as possible.</i>

06:50.680 --> 06:51.180
<b>Read</b>

06:51.550 --> 06:52.050
<b>Read</b>

06:52.430 --> 06:53.180
<b>Read</b>

06:53.550 --> 06:54.050
<b>Read</b>

06:54.430 --> 06:55.060
<b>Read</b>

06:55.060 --> 06:59.060
<i>To be honest, it's kind of cute...</i>

06:59.060 --> 07:03.710
<i>But when I see him focusing so 
intently on something like this,</i>

06:59.810 --> 07:00.560
<b>Read</b>

07:00.940 --> 07:01.690
<b>Read</b>

07:02.060 --> 07:02.810
<b>Read</b>

07:03.190 --> 07:03.940
<b>Read</b>

07:04.600 --> 07:06.420
<i>I kinda wanna mess with him!</i>

07:06.070 --> 07:07.570
<b>Desire for mischief activated!</b>

07:15.390 --> 07:19.110
Toast?! Come on, why are you eating my hair?!

07:19.110 --> 07:24.960
Hey! What is this persistent urge 
of yours to eat my head?! Seriously!

07:26.190 --> 07:29.170
Now, now, Toast, you can't interrupt Daddy.

07:31.140 --> 07:33.980
You are honestly such a 
troublesome little kitty.

07:33.980 --> 07:35.390
We'll need to be careful.

07:35.390 --> 07:38.340
I-Is it okay if I read a bit more?

07:38.340 --> 07:40.350
Of course. Enjoy yourself.

07:40.810 --> 07:44.620
<i>Lately, I've developed a guilty pleasure.</i>

07:44.620 --> 07:46.980
<i>When I see my darling with 
that serious look on his face,</i>

07:47.440 --> 07:50.740
<i>I feel this pressing urge to mess with him.</i>

07:51.250 --> 07:55.990
<i>I know better than to indulge when 
he's busy with work, of course,</i>

07:56.570 --> 07:59.820
<i>but if it's not work, 
then it can't hurt, right?</i>

08:00.750 --> 08:03.280
Darling, have you felt worn out lately?

08:03.280 --> 08:05.360
Huh? Not at all, why?

08:05.360 --> 08:08.900
No, I'm sure you have. 
This calls for a massage.

08:09.460 --> 08:11.970
That being the case, 
let me rub your shoulders.

08:11.970 --> 08:14.260
O-Okay, thanks.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.010
Now, then...

08:16.010 --> 08:16.780
Here!

08:19.050 --> 08:22.220
Hang on, Tsukasa-chan! 
Why were you tickling me?

08:22.220 --> 08:24.640
Wait, did I do that wrong?

08:24.640 --> 08:28.400
Y-Yeah, you did! You can't go after 
my ribs out of the blue like that.

08:28.400 --> 08:31.900
I see. I won't do it without warning again.

08:32.030 --> 08:35.770
Exactly. If you're going to rub something, 
make it my shoulders, please.

08:35.770 --> 08:36.810
Okay?

08:36.810 --> 08:38.410
Okay, I've got it.

08:38.410 --> 08:40.300
Tsukasa-chan never lies!

08:40.300 --> 08:42.540
Now, let me just rub your sides.

08:45.050 --> 08:48.670
Hey! No! I asked you not to tickle me!

08:48.670 --> 08:52.380
But I warned you beforehand this time.

08:52.380 --> 08:54.100
A warning doesn't change anything!

08:54.100 --> 08:56.050
You rub the shoulders!
 The shoulders, por favor!

08:57.220 --> 08:59.390
I think your Spanish might be 
a little advanced for me.

08:59.390 --> 09:01.640
It wasn't advanced at all!

09:01.640 --> 09:03.060
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

09:04.000 --> 09:07.160
Come on, that look makes it 
obvious what you're trying to do!

09:07.920 --> 09:12.780
Sorry, sorry! You were just too cute, 
the way you were focused on that manga.

09:12.780 --> 09:14.320
Come on...

09:14.600 --> 09:17.820
What made you suddenly start 
reading shojo manga, though?

09:19.400 --> 09:23.330
W-Well, there was... n-no real reason, I'd say.

09:23.790 --> 09:26.730
<i>It'd be way too embarrassing to admit 
that I started because I was trying</i>

09:26.730 --> 09:28.520
<i>to figure out how to express my love better,</i>

09:28.520 --> 09:32.110
<i>but then got hooked because 
of how entertaining they are!</i>

09:32.110 --> 09:35.610
Darling. You tried to brush 
that off, didn't you?

09:35.610 --> 09:37.250
Huh?! Wh-What makes you say that?

09:37.250 --> 09:41.260
Tsukasa-chan is pretty perceptive 
about this kind of thing.

09:41.260 --> 09:44.950
So stop being embarrassed and tell 
the truth. What brought all this on?

09:44.950 --> 09:46.970
Well, it's like I said...

09:46.970 --> 09:48.350
Like what you said?

09:58.160 --> 10:01.630
Ugh, you're so cute, I just had to kiss you.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.830
What's the big idea? Seriously.

10:02.830 --> 10:04.740
What's what big idea? What?

10:04.740 --> 10:07.390
Now fess up and tell the truth!

10:07.390 --> 10:09.060
Well, um...

10:10.190 --> 10:14.250
I wanted to convey how much I love you.

10:15.390 --> 10:19.610
And saying stuff like that... 
If it's before you're going out,

10:19.610 --> 10:24.890
all you need to do is find the right 
moment to admit how you feel, right?

10:25.590 --> 10:27.140
But once you're married,

10:27.140 --> 10:31.650
I think you need to be able to tell someone 
that sort of thing casually in daily life.

10:31.650 --> 10:37.630
But it's hard to do that sort of thing 
without practice or study, so...

10:38.430 --> 10:43.210
So you thought you'd read 
shojo manga for study?

10:43.210 --> 10:48.930
Y-Yeah. And then it was so 
interesting, I got hooked.

10:48.930 --> 10:50.670
I-I see.

10:50.990 --> 10:53.110
Damn, darling, how cute <i>are</i> you?

10:54.060 --> 10:58.300
Well, I appreciate you thinking about 
that sort of thing so seriously.

10:58.570 --> 11:02.800
Now, why don't you show me 
the fruits of your study?

11:03.490 --> 11:04.430
Huh?!

11:04.430 --> 11:05.180
Now!

11:05.180 --> 11:08.410
Wait, are you still making fun of me now?

11:08.410 --> 11:11.130
Not at all, no! I'm totally serious!

11:11.130 --> 11:12.940
I know you're not!

11:12.940 --> 11:15.720
I'm being super serious right now.
 Tsukasa-chan never lies!

11:15.720 --> 11:16.770
So now.

11:16.770 --> 11:18.530
Y-You're being serious right now?

11:18.530 --> 11:19.440
Very much so.

11:20.330 --> 11:22.630
Well...

11:23.280 --> 11:29.330
T-Tsukasa-chan, I love you the 
most in the entire universe.

11:30.720 --> 11:32.700
What the heck was that cute nonsense?!

11:32.700 --> 11:34.030
Play fair, darling!

11:34.030 --> 11:36.590
Wait, are you mad?!

11:37.020 --> 11:40.090
Well, in that case, how about more specifics?

11:40.650 --> 11:42.350
How much do you love me?

11:42.350 --> 11:47.040
Well, you're always so cute.

11:47.040 --> 11:51.650
It's like every time I see you, 
I feel like I love you more.

11:58.090 --> 12:01.010
Tsukassan... You're in a good mood.

12:01.010 --> 12:02.950
Something nice happen?

12:05.800 --> 12:06.850
Not telling.

12:13.220 --> 12:17.300
I'm curious, Senpai. Do you two 
ever get in the bath together?

12:19.170 --> 12:21.240
Oh, did you not hear me? I was asking...

12:21.240 --> 12:22.720
I did hear you, actually!

12:23.110 --> 12:26.420
Why are you in the men's 
bath like it's no big deal?!

12:26.420 --> 12:27.220
Well?

12:27.620 --> 12:29.220
How about it? What's the answer?

12:29.800 --> 12:34.730
I-I mean, we are married, 
so I would like to do that...

12:34.730 --> 12:36.480
But that building doesn't have a bath.

12:36.910 --> 12:43.860
Granted, if we move into a new apartment that 
has one, then I'd love to do that every day.

12:44.240 --> 12:47.200
So the desire exists, at least.

12:47.200 --> 12:49.760
In that case, do you wanna join her now?

12:49.760 --> 12:50.630
Huh?

12:50.890 --> 12:55.250
Business hours are over, 
and the customers are all gone.

12:55.250 --> 12:58.180
You can pop into the women's 
bath now, if you want.

12:58.180 --> 12:59.790
What?! B-But...

12:59.790 --> 13:03.030
You guys already got in the bath 
together at Kusatsu, right?

13:03.030 --> 13:06.040
Tsukassan still seems to be bathing,

13:06.040 --> 13:10.480
so I'll unlock the door that 
leads to the women's bath.

13:10.480 --> 13:15.270
You two can enjoy some quality time 
washing each other's backs or something.

13:16.030 --> 13:17.990
A-Are you sure it's okay?

13:17.990 --> 13:19.150
You bet.

13:19.150 --> 13:23.940
Just don't have too much fun 
and make a lot of noise, okay?

13:23.940 --> 13:26.620
Sound really carries in this place.

13:26.620 --> 13:29.080
W-We wouldn't go that far!

13:31.160 --> 13:32.560
Okay, I'm going!

13:32.560 --> 13:33.410
Whoa, hang on!

13:33.850 --> 13:37.390
Hold on a sec! Are you actually 
coming over here, darling?!

13:37.390 --> 13:39.700
Did you hear us?

13:39.700 --> 13:41.490
Of course I did!

13:41.490 --> 13:44.170
Why am I not a part of this conversation?!

13:44.510 --> 13:47.440
Should I cancel the spousal 
quality time, then?

13:47.440 --> 13:49.890
Huh? Well, I mean...

13:51.530 --> 13:55.760
I-If you... turn the lights off,
 then it's okay.

13:56.690 --> 13:59.950
You heard her. Good for you, Senpai.

14:00.340 --> 14:04.400
I'm going to go clean up at the front desk,

14:04.400 --> 14:06.230
so enjoy yourselves!

14:09.820 --> 14:13.790
<i>Getting in the bath with your 
wife is a totally normal thing.</i>

14:13.790 --> 14:18.330
<i>If anything, it's a good thing! The kind of 
thing that the government would endorse!</i>

14:18.800 --> 14:23.020
<i>Married couples getting along 
contributes to world peace!</i>

14:23.020 --> 14:23.940
<i>I think!</i>

14:25.090 --> 14:29.000
W-Well, Tsukasa-chan, can I come in?

14:29.660 --> 14:32.920
S-Sure... Go ahead.

14:54.830 --> 14:55.370
It...

14:57.450 --> 15:01.570
It's the first time we've done 
this since the Kusatsu trip, huh?

15:01.570 --> 15:03.300
Th-That's right.

15:03.300 --> 15:06.550
Seriously, I have no idea 
what Kaname was thinking,

15:06.550 --> 15:08.590
suggesting something like 
this out of the blue...

15:08.590 --> 15:10.820
Y-Yeah.

15:10.820 --> 15:12.840
I'm kinda glad she did, though.

15:13.360 --> 15:15.740
I mean, so am I.

15:18.590 --> 15:20.730
Don't look too closely, okay?

15:22.210 --> 15:23.990
This isn't like Kusatsu.

15:24.640 --> 15:27.480
The water's clear, so...

15:28.280 --> 15:31.320
You can see... everything.

15:34.490 --> 15:36.240
<i>Th-This is bad.</i>

15:36.790 --> 15:42.250
<i>She warned us not to make any noise,
 but I feel like I'm gonna!</i>

15:43.050 --> 15:46.590
How much do you think voices carry in here?

15:46.590 --> 15:47.380
Huh?

15:47.380 --> 15:49.930
Well, it's just that...

15:49.930 --> 15:54.870
We probably shouldn't do anything that 
Kaname-chan will be able to hear.

16:02.630 --> 16:03.900
Honestly...

16:04.640 --> 16:07.460
It's like this stuff is always the 
first thing on your mind, Nasa-kun.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.400
Sorry!

16:09.780 --> 16:12.400
Did you not want to?

16:14.440 --> 16:15.910
You are so stupid!

16:17.630 --> 16:18.880
If I didn't want to...

16:20.370 --> 16:22.160
I wouldn't have let you in here at all!

16:22.470 --> 16:24.540
<i>T-Too stimulating!</i>

16:25.310 --> 16:27.410
Now turn the other way.

16:27.410 --> 16:28.800
O-Okay!

16:40.630 --> 16:42.810
Tsukasa-chan, are you getting out already?

16:42.810 --> 16:47.200
No! I was just thinking 
about using the sauna.

16:47.200 --> 16:51.030
If you want to join me, feel free, darling.

16:55.940 --> 16:58.440
<i>If she didn't want to, 
she wouldn't have let me in.</i>

16:58.440 --> 17:00.030
<i>If you really didn't want to...</i>

17:00.030 --> 17:01.310
<i>If she didn't—</i>

17:01.310 --> 17:04.080
<i>This is like a scene out of a shojo manga!</i>

17:04.390 --> 17:06.580
<i>Which means I need to go!</i>

17:07.130 --> 17:11.400
<i>Getting into the bath and then the sauna</i>

17:11.400 --> 17:14.090
<i>with my wife is for the sake of world peace!</i>

17:18.240 --> 17:20.600
<i>S-So hot!</i>

17:20.600 --> 17:23.600
<i>Come to think of it, the sauna here...</i>

17:23.600 --> 17:26.980
<i>has the temperature set really high!</i>

17:26.980 --> 17:30.860
<i>In a setup like this, I'll have 
maybe five minutes to do stuff!</i>

17:31.210 --> 17:35.180
<i>But will I be able to maintain 
my libidinous feelings—</i>

17:35.740 --> 17:38.990
<i>I mean, my love for my wife, 
in the midst of this scorching heat?!</i>

17:39.840 --> 17:40.990
<i>Will I?</i>

17:41.910 --> 17:43.020
<i>Will I?!</i>

17:45.230 --> 17:47.000
Darling, you came.

17:47.000 --> 17:49.000
<i>Yeah, this'll be easy!</i>

17:49.290 --> 17:51.460
C-Can I sit next to you?

17:51.460 --> 17:52.420
Of course.

17:53.860 --> 17:56.950
I love how hot the sauna here is.

17:56.950 --> 17:58.770
D-Do you?

17:59.470 --> 18:02.260
How long do you usually stay in the sauna?

18:02.560 --> 18:04.270
As long as I can, of course.

18:04.270 --> 18:06.560
<i>Well, that's very manly!</i>

18:06.560 --> 18:09.270
You see, a sauna, darling...

18:09.660 --> 18:11.790
is a battle against yourself.

18:11.790 --> 18:14.570
Amidst this overwhelming heat,

18:14.570 --> 18:17.230
you're able to ask yourself 
the hard questions.

18:17.230 --> 18:19.530
I-I see.

18:22.330 --> 18:25.100
<i>This isn't what I expected!</i>

18:25.950 --> 18:28.690
You must love saunas, huh, Tsukasa-chan?

18:28.690 --> 18:30.910
Not exactly, no.

18:30.910 --> 18:31.540
Huh?

18:31.540 --> 18:35.420
It's not me that loves saunas. 
All of humanity does!

18:35.420 --> 18:37.550
I-I see.

18:38.370 --> 18:42.680
<i>Despite a mostly naked man and woman 
being together in a dark, enclosed space,</i>

18:42.680 --> 18:45.060
<i>the atmosphere isn't even a little spicy!</i>

18:45.470 --> 18:51.690
<i>Well, I guess fooling around in a sauna 
room is a bad idea in the first place.</i>

18:51.690 --> 18:54.440
<i>But mankind has always 
challenged new frontiers!</i>

18:58.720 --> 19:01.610
Wh-What are you doing, Tsukasa-chan?

19:02.160 --> 19:05.330
Creating some steam so it'll get hotter in here.

19:05.760 --> 19:08.060
I was feeling like more of a challenge.

19:08.060 --> 19:10.580
That's not the kind of challenge I meant!

19:11.120 --> 19:13.720
Do you like saunas, darling?

19:13.720 --> 19:15.960
Well, let's see...

19:15.960 --> 19:18.460
I-I'm not great with them, to be honest.

19:19.240 --> 19:23.380
Which is why I usually get out after two or 
three minutes, when it becomes unbearable.

19:23.380 --> 19:25.280
You've got the wrong idea, darling.

19:25.280 --> 19:28.760
A sauna begins with enduring 
the first three minutes.

19:29.500 --> 19:32.940
The first three minutes are before 
your body gets used to the heat,

19:32.940 --> 19:35.960
so it can be uncomfortable, and even painful.

19:35.960 --> 19:41.300
Which is why amateurs can't bear those first 
three minutes, and tend to run out right away.

19:37.490 --> 19:38.800
Amateurs?!

19:41.300 --> 19:42.490
But that's wrong!

19:42.800 --> 19:46.580
You endure the first three minutes, 
and that's when the first door opens!

19:46.580 --> 19:47.240
What door?

19:47.240 --> 19:49.440
And when that door opens,

19:49.440 --> 19:52.970
the heat spreads throughout your body, 
and then it becomes comfortable!

19:52.970 --> 19:54.460
The heat is our friend!

19:54.460 --> 19:55.630
We're friends?!

19:56.270 --> 19:59.510
You need to hang in there until 
that friendship blossoms.

19:59.960 --> 20:02.790
Let's open the door together, darling!

20:02.790 --> 20:05.390
<i>Oh, boy, she seems really serious about this.</i>

20:05.720 --> 20:09.800
O-Okay, I'll try my best.

20:10.390 --> 20:12.200
Kaname-chan!

20:13.140 --> 20:15.710
Did you drain the bathwater already?

20:15.710 --> 20:19.130
Not yet. But don't go in the women's bath.

20:19.130 --> 20:20.150
Why not?

20:20.550 --> 20:24.570
Because Senpai and Tsukassan are having 
some private time in there right now.

20:25.110 --> 20:27.530
What the heck?! 
That's straight out of a rom-com!

20:27.530 --> 20:29.640
Well, they're already married,

20:29.640 --> 20:32.510
so there won't be any of that 
"Ew, perv!" stuff like in rom-coms.

20:32.510 --> 20:35.040
That just means it's gonna 
be even more intense!

20:35.040 --> 20:37.910
Anyway, if you're going in, 
make sure to use the men's bath.

20:37.910 --> 20:39.730
G-Got it.

20:39.730 --> 20:41.800
All the customers left already, right?

20:44.830 --> 20:48.300
Aw, crap. I dozed off in the sauna.

20:49.470 --> 20:54.310
m 251 285 l 251 333 393 333 393 285

20:49.470 --> 20:54.310
<b>3 Minutes Later</b>

20:51.040 --> 20:54.310
<i>This is bad. No doors are opening at all.</i>

20:54.690 --> 20:57.610
<i>And this heat doesn't seem at all friendly!</i>

20:57.610 --> 21:01.750
<i>Is my wife seriously, 
seriously enduring this heat?</i>

21:01.750 --> 21:04.150
<i>It's getting harder and harder to endure!</i>

21:04.150 --> 21:07.190
<i>Is this really okay, Tsukasa-chan?!</i>

21:12.980 --> 21:15.330
<i>I'll try to commune with 
the heat for a bit longer.</i>

21:15.860 --> 21:18.580
<i>But even if I do, time's running out.</i>

21:18.580 --> 21:21.590
<i>Which means my only choice is to....</i>

21:24.130 --> 21:26.220
<i>Even if the heat wipes me out,</i>

21:26.220 --> 21:28.450
<i>I want to have some contact!</i>

21:28.450 --> 21:31.220
<i>As I see my wife enduring 
the heat of the sauna,</i>

21:31.220 --> 21:34.670
<i>glistening with sweat, 
she's as cute as she's ever been!</i>

21:34.670 --> 21:38.260
<i>Normally, I wouldn't be able to touch 
someone like that, but we're married!</i>

21:38.260 --> 21:42.360
<i>And married couples getting along 
contributes to world peace!</i>

21:42.360 --> 21:43.480
Tsukasa-chan...

21:46.480 --> 21:49.900
It's already hot enough. 
Are you sure you want to?

21:49.900 --> 21:50.620
Yeah.

21:51.260 --> 21:57.040
Because my feelings for you 
burn way hotter than this.

21:59.270 --> 22:02.930
Looks like your practice 
is paying off, darling.

22:02.930 --> 22:04.630
Aw, come on!

22:04.630 --> 22:07.130
If you're gonna make fun 
of me, then take this!

22:07.380 --> 22:10.280
H-Hey! My towel's gonna fall off.

22:10.280 --> 22:14.390
W-Would that be a bad thing?

22:14.390 --> 22:18.640
W-Well... n-not really...

22:23.900 --> 22:28.430
Eek! Who the heck are you?!

22:28.430 --> 22:30.900
What was that, darling?

22:30.900 --> 22:33.160
Aya-san's voice, I think.

22:33.160 --> 22:37.350
The sound in here really seems 
to carry. Let's get out.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.660
Y-Yeah.

22:38.660 --> 22:42.010
Why were you in there when I was going in?!

22:41.670 --> 22:48.170
<b><i>Gripe</i></b>

22:42.010 --> 22:45.580
What is wrong with you?! 
Unbelievable! Give me a break!

22:42.010 --> 22:46.490
Well, it <i>was</i> the men's bath...

22:45.580 --> 22:47.320
I don't wanna hear your logic!

22:47.320 --> 22:49.610
I wanna know how you're 
going to make this right!

22:49.610 --> 22:51.180
Make it right?

22:51.180 --> 22:53.590
Are you going to, or not?! Which is it?!

22:51.180 --> 22:56.930
<b><i>Gripe</i></b>

22:53.590 --> 22:56.930
Sorry about all this, Senpai.

22:56.930 --> 22:59.730
Seems this rom-com nonsense got in your way.

23:01.010 --> 23:04.350
Good grief. Just when things were going well...

23:04.350 --> 23:05.820
What a shame.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.890
It was a shame?

23:08.570 --> 23:11.970
I mean, it's a shame what happened to Aya!

23:11.970 --> 23:14.090
I-I see...

23:14.090 --> 23:15.950
Y-Yeah.

23:16.550 --> 23:17.980
What else?

23:17.980 --> 23:18.950
Right...

23:20.010 --> 23:23.900
<i>I thought about how I'd like to 
get in the sauna together again.</i>

23:24.960 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

23:25.960 --> 23:28.970
Yuzaki-kun, do you ever argue 
with your wife about food?

23:28.970 --> 23:31.660
Not at all. Do you, Yanagi-sensei?

23:31.660 --> 23:33.590
About whether fried eggs get
soy sauce or Worcestershire,

23:33.590 --> 23:35.360
and whether or not to mix 
your curry into your rice.

23:35.360 --> 23:37.970
Still, food does taste better when you 
have someone to share it with, right?

23:37.970 --> 23:39.980
You really are an honor student!
